+```text
+A=a(u,Z)=u^2-Zu^4+2Z^2u^6-5Z^3u^8+...,
+R^_Phi=C[Z][[u]],        {u,Z}=2+4Za(u,Z).                 (1.5)
+```
+
+Consequently, if
