+O=2A^2(Q_A S_0-Q(S_0)_A)
+  +4(P_A(R_0)_Z-P_Z(R_0)_A
+       +H(Q_A(S_0)_Z-Q_Z(S_0)_A))
+  +c(Q(S_0)_Z-Q_ZS_0).                                    (1.3O)
+```
+
+Thus the complete coefficient-level constant-Jacobian constraint is the
+polynomial identity system
