+
+[A^1]E:  kappa sigma'-9kappa Z sigma
+          +6D(3Z^2-1)-12ZL+2kappa Z-(9/2)kappa c_*=0,     (3.5)
+
+[A^1]O:  C'E-CE'=-(kappa/4)L'-(9kappa/8)D
+                   +(3kappa Z/8)D'+(3kappa^2/8)Z,         (3.6)
+
+[A^3]O:  DL'-D'L=0,                                      (3.7)
+```
+
+where all solutions of (3.4) have been written
