+## 1. Constraint system imposed by the promoted packets
+
+### 1.1 Exact polynomial equations
+
+Every element of `R` has a unique normal form (`structure:145-149`).  Write
+
+```text
+f=P(A,Z)+U Q(A,Z),       g=R_0(A,Z)+U S_0(A,Z),             (1.1)
