+## 2. Lowest-complexity admissible shape and free parameters
+
+Use lexicographic complexity
+
+```text
+(max(deg p,deg r), deg p+deg r,
+ max(deg q_1,deg s_1),
+ max(deg_A P,deg_A Q,deg_A R_0,deg_A S_0)).                (2.1)
+```
