+```text
+sigma=-a_1/a_2,
+tau_0=sigma^2+(b_2 sigma+b_1)/b_3,
+Delta=sigma^2-4tau_0
+     =-3sigma^2-4(b_2 sigma+b_1)/b_3.                     (2.3)
